# Half-revolution rotating-drum comparison using the legacy JKR lookup table.
atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
read_data comparison-results/common_settled.data
neighbor 0.0032 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
timestep 1e-5

fix young all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 5e6 9.2e6
fix poisson all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3 0.3
fix restitution all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 0.5 0.5 0.5 0.5
fix friction all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 0.8 0.7 0.7 1.0
fix adhesion all property/global workOfAdhesion peratomtypepair 2 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.3
fix resolution all property/global resolutionJKR scalar 1e-4

fix cad all mesh/surface file ../rotating_drum_JKR/mesh/rotating_drum_mm.stl type 2 scale 0.001
fix side all mesh/surface file ../rotating_drum_JKR/mesh/rotating_drum_side_mm.stl type 2 scale 0.001
fix walls all wall/gran model jkr tangential history mesh n_meshes 2 meshes cad side
pair_style gran model jkr tangential history
pair_coeff * *
fix gravity all gravity 9.81 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0
fix integrate all nve/sphere
fix rotate all move/mesh mesh cad rotate origin 0.0 0.0 0.0 axis 0.0 1.0 0.0 period 2.0

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step atoms ke time
thermo_modify lost error norm no
dump trajectory all custom 1000 comparison-results/legacy/trajectory.dump id type radius density x y z vx vy vz
dump_modify trajectory sort id format "%d %d %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g %.17g"
run 100000
